### UltraFace RFB-320
    File:      public/models/ultraface-RFB-320.onnx
    Source:    Ultra-Light-Fast-Generic-Face-Detector-1MB —
               https://github.com/Linzaer/Ultra-Light-Fast-Generic-Face-Detector-1MB
